{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/1457","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/1457/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/1457/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/1457/events","html_url":"https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/1457","id":955075077,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU5NTUwNzUwNzc=","number":1457,"title":"Fiber Client does multiple requests when using Timeout() and MaxRedirectsCount() 🐛 ","user":{"login":"NicolasGB","id":17547539,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTQ3NTM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17547539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB","html_url":"https://github.com/NicolasGB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NicolasGB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2064310319,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDY0MzEwMzE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/labels/%E2%98%A2%EF%B8%8F%20Bug","name":"☢️ Bug","color":"e11d21","default":false,"description":""},{"id":2454811973,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDU0ODExOTcz","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/labels/%F0%9F%91%8D%20Accepting%20PR","name":"👍 Accepting PR","color":"f9d0c4","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2021-07-28T17:25:48Z","updated_at":"2021-08-02T08:43:11Z","closed_at":"2021-08-02T08:43:11Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Fiber version**\r\n2.15.0\r\n**Issue description**\r\nWith fiber.Client whenever you use a.Timeout() or a.MaxRedirectsCount() a request is made by any of these functions, therefore, more than one HTTP request is sent.\r\n**Code snippet**\r\nA first API:\r\n```go\r\npackage main\r\n\r\nimport (\r\n\t\"fmt\"\r\n\t\"github.com/gofiber/fiber/v2\"\r\n\t\"log\"\r\n\t\"time\"\r\n)\r\n\r\nfunc main() {\r\n\tapp := fiber.New()\r\n\r\n\tapp.Get(\"test\", func(c *fiber.Ctx) error {\r\n\r\n\t\ta := fiber.AcquireAgent()\r\n\t\tdefer fiber.ReleaseAgent(a)\r\n\r\n\t\tr := fiber.AcquireResponse()\r\n\t\tdefer fiber.ReleaseResponse(r)\r\n\r\n\t\ta.Reuse()\r\n\t\t//Set request\r\n\t\treq := a.Request()\r\n\t\treq.Header.SetMethod(fiber.MethodGet)\r\n\t\turi := \"http://127.0.0.1:3001/\"\r\n\t\treq.SetRequestURI(uri)\r\n\r\n\t\tif err := a.Parse(); err != nil {\r\n\t\t\tfmt.Println(err.Error())\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\t//Return\r\n\t\t_, _, _ = a.SetResponse(r).Timeout(5 * time.Second).MaxRedirectsCount(1).Bytes()\r\n\t\treturn c.SendStatus(200)\r\n\t})\r\n\tlog.Fatal(app.Listen(\":3000\"))\r\n}\r\n```\r\nA second API:\r\n```go\r\npackage main\r\n\r\nimport (\r\n\t\"github.com/gofiber/fiber/v2\"\r\n\t\"github.com/gofiber/fiber/v2/middleware/logger\"\r\n\t\"log\"\r\n)\r\n\r\nfunc main() {\r\n\tapp := fiber.New()\r\n\r\n\tapp.Use(logger.New())\r\n\tapp.Get(\"/\", func(c *fiber.Ctx) error {\r\n\t\treturn c.SendStatus(200)\r\n\t})\r\n\tlog.Fatal(app.Listen(\":3001\"))\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nOutput:\r\n\r\nThe second API receives a request for each of the mentioned methods.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/17547539/127368104-518cfe67-1661-4ff8-bfbd-465acc713f0b.png)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"ReneWerner87","id":7063188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjMxODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7063188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87","html_url":"https://github.com/ReneWerner87","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReneWerner87/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/1457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/1457/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}